  {
   "text": "Owen let go of his pole to grab a branch.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.497
  },
  {
   "text": "It slid twenty feet down the snowy slope.",
   "start": 2.597,
   "end": 4.582
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix: slide your hand up through the strap from below, then grip over it.",
   "start": 4.732,
   "end": 8.805
  },
  {
   "text": "The strap carries weight and the pole stays.",
   "start": 8.905,
   "end": 11.204
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this.",
   "start": 11.504,
   "end": 12.208
  }
